  "baseRefName": "main",
  "body": "## Summary\n- Import LTAIP full macro-packet series into the repo: TP-LTAIP-H0-001..008 and TP-LTAIP-POST-009..012 (JSON + companion MD).\n- Add Task Orchestrator load-plan artifacts under `docs/ops/load-plans/` (canonical plan, REST epics payload, task tree, v3 advisory, load instructions).\n- Add dry-run/apply loader `scripts/leantime-ai-parity/load_task_orchestrator.py`, REST epics schema, and payload unit test.\n\n## Scope / non-goals\n- **Does not** execute any task packet.\n- **Does not** perform a live Task Orchestrator write (`live_task_orchestrator_load: PENDING_LOAD`; apply requires explicit `--approve LTAIP_TASK_ORCHESTRATOR_LOAD`).\n- Filename hygiene: overlay `LTAIP-H0-LOAD-INSTRUCTIONS.md` renamed to `ltaip-h0-load-instructions.md`.\n\n## Validation\n- jsonschema validate: 12/12 packets against `docs/03-reference/spec/dopetask/dopetask-canonical-spec.json`\n- `python -m json.tool` on load plan + epics payload\n- `load_task_orchestrator.py --dry-run` \u2192 13 entries (root + 12 epics), no network write\n- `pytest -q tests/prototypes/leantime-ai-parity/test_task_orchestrator_load_payload.py`\n- docs hygiene / filename hygiene / root hygiene on imported paths\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Schema-validate all `task-packets/leantime-ai-parity/*.json`\n- [x] Dry-run loader against `task_orchestrator_epics-LTAIP-H0.json`\n- [x] Unit test for load payload\n- [ ] (separate authorization) live TO load with `--approve LTAIP_TASK_ORCHESTRATOR_LOAD` only after operator gate\n\n## Source\n- Overlay: `LTAIP-FULL-MACROPACKETS-001/repo-overlay`\n- Worktree: `dopemux-mvp-wt-LTAIP-PACKET-IMPORT` branch `docs/ltaip-full-packet-import`",
